.\" MCX Package Manager — Man Page
.TH MCX 1 "2026-08-02" "mcx 7.0.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
mcx \- the Cudane package manager
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B mcx
.RI [ options ]
.I command
.RI [ args ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B mcx
installs, removes, and upgrades Cudane packages, manages repositories, builds
packages, and integrates cps plugins, themes, and TUIs into a package-aware
prompt. Every command accepts short and long spellings plus aliases.
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.B install, in, add (\fB-i\fR) \fIPACKAGE...\fR
Install packages. Options:
.BR \-\-only\-required ,
.BR \-\-with\-dev ,
.BR \-\-components LIST ,
.BR \-\-exclude LIST ,
.BR \-\-only BIN .
.TP
.B add, local, package, xcs (\fB-a\fR) \fIFILE.xcs\fR
Install a locally built package archive.
.TP
.B remove, rm, uninstall, delete (\fB-r\fR) \fIPACKAGE...\fR
Remove packages; \fB\-\-components LIST\fR or \fB\-\-purge\fR.
.TP
.B purge, full\-remove \fIPACKAGE...\fR
Remove a package together with its caches and orphaned data.
.TP
.B search, find, look (\fB-s\fR) \fIPATTERN\fR
Search available packages.
.TP
.B update, refresh, sync (\fB-u\fR)
Refresh repository metadata.
.TP
.B upgrade, up, dist\-upgrade (\fB-U\fR)
Upgrade installed packages; \fB\-\-components LIST\fR, \fB\-\-only BIN\fR.
.TP
.B query, info, show (\fB-q\fR) \fIPACKAGE\fR
Show package information.
.TP
.B clean, wipe, clear (\fB-c\fR)
Clear package caches.
.TP
.B verify, check, certify (\fB-V\fR)
Verify installed packages against their metadata.
.TP
.B fix, repair (\fB-f\fR)
Repair broken or incomplete installations.
.TP
.B config, cfg, settings (\fB-C\fR)
Manage configuration; \fB\-\-generate\fR writes default config.ini,
repo.ini, and profile.ini.
.TP
.B history, log, record (\fB-H\fR)
Show the transaction history.
.TP
.B build, make, create (\fB-b\fR)
Build a package.
.TP
.B repo\-add / repo\-remove / repo\-list / repo\-sync / repo\-enable / repo\-disable / repo\-info
Manage repositories (also \fBra\fR, \fBrr\fR, \fBrl\fR, \fBrs\fR, \fBre\fR,
\fBrd\fR, \fBri\fR).
.TP
.B self\-update
Update mcx itself.
.TP
.B vendor \fISUBCOMMAND\fR
Manage vendored toolchains and sources.
.TP
.B completion
Generate shell completion scripts.
.TP
.B cgroup \fISUBCOMMAND\fR
Manage cgroup integration.
.TP
.B hook\-plugin \fISUBCOMMAND\fR
Manage hook plugins.
.TP
.B plugin | theme | tui \fISUBCOMMAND\fR
Manage cps plugins, themes, and TUIs.
.TP
.B service \fIARGS\fR
Package-service management (trailing args passed through).
.TP
.B command\-not\-found \fIARG\fR
Look up a missing command for package suggestion.
.TP
.B binindex \fIARG\fR
Manage the binary index.
.TP
.B autoremove, ar, autoclean
Remove orphaned packages (dry-run unless \fB\-\-actually\-remove\fR).
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-root \fIDIR\fR
Operate on an alternate installation root.
.TP
.B \-v, \-\-version
Print version.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I /etc/mcx/config.ini , /etc/mcx/repo.ini , /etc/mcx/profile.ini
Default configuration, repositories, and profiles.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR ous (1),
.BR cps (1)
